  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]  [Bm7/A]\n[E7sus4]  [D/A]\n[Asus2]  [C#m]\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bm]I'd like to\n[E7]walk around in your\n[Asus2]mind [C#m]someday\n[Bm]  [E7]\n[Bm]I'd like to\n[E7]walk all over the\n[Asus2]things you say [C#m]to me\n[Bm]  [E7]\n[Bm]I'd like to\n[E7]run and jump on your\n[C#m][Asus2]solitude\n[Bm]  [E7]\n[Bm]I'd like to\n[E7]rearrange your\n[Asus2]attitude [C#m]to me\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]You [Bm7/A]say you just\n[E7sus4]want peace [D/A]and to\n[E7sus4]never [D/A]hurt any-\n[A]one\n[G]You [Bm7/A]see the end\n[E7sus4]before [D/A]the be-\n[E7sus4]ginning has [D/A]ever begun\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bm]I would dis-\n[E7]turb your easy tran-\n[C#m][Asus2]quillity\n[Bm]  [E7]\n[Bm]I'd turn a-\n[E7]way the sad im-\n[Asus2]possibility [C#m]of your smile\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Violin Solo]\n[Bm]\n[E7]\n[Asus2]  [C#m]\n[Bm]  [E7]\n[Bm]\n[E7]\n[Asus2]  [C#m]\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]I'd [Bm7/A]sit there in\n[E7sus4]the sun [D/A]of the\n[E7sus4]things I [D/A]like about\n[A]you\n[G]I'd [Bm7/A]sing my songs\n[E7sus4]and find [D/A]out\n[E7sus4]just what they [D/A]mean to you\n[Bm]  [E7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Gm]But most of\n[F]all I'd like you to\n[Bb]be [Bb/A]unaware\n[Gm7]  [F7]\n[Gm]Then I'd just\n[F]wander away, trailing\n[Bb]palm leaves [Bb/A]behind me So you\n[Gm7]don't even [F7]know I've been there\n\n[Outro]\n[Ab]\n[Bb]",
